#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the user manual for &kphotoalbum; &mdash; a digital image cataloguing "
"software that supports annotation, browsing, searching and viewing of digital "
"images and videos. If you are not the type who likes reading documentation, "
"but "
"rather just want to try out things, here are a few alternatives:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Go to the <ulink url=\"http://www.kphotoalbum.org/\">"
"&kphotoalbum; Homepage</ulink>, and look at the quick overview, screen "
"shoots, "
"and introduction videos."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Start &kphotoalbum;, and accept its offer for a demo (If this is your first "
"time you start it), or go to <guimenu>Help</guimenu> "
"menu and select <guimenuitem>Run &kphotoalbum; demo</guimenuitem>"
". That will load &kphotoalbum; with a number of images, and let you browse "
"around."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you prefer to print out this document, then you may find it as on long PDF "
"document at <ulink url=\"http://docs.kde.org/\">&kde; docs</ulink>"
". A direct link is available at <ulink "
"url=\"http://kphotoalbum.org/index.php?page=documentation\">"
"&kphotoalbum;'s Homepage</ulink>."
msgstr ""

